{"skill":{"slug":"web-scraping","displayName":"Web Scraping"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773817868323,"changelog":"- Initial release of the web-scraping skill.\n- Supports data extraction from both static and dynamic websites.\n- Automatically chooses between direct HTML fetching and browser automation based on site complexity and interaction needs.\n- Handles dynamic content, authentication, infinite scroll, pagination, and search/filter flows.\n- Outputs structured data in concise bullet lists, JSON, or CSV formats.\n- Includes reliability rules for deduplication, error handling, and workspace file management.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2329,"sha256":"729b45e380e047077a937216c47c3e9c41ce5041b6f55593c9871f87200c2061","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1988,"sha256":"83849a5b919f14ff5fa269dec662d47682f3027d6a1e007ecdf62c57807e1e1d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789191110318,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f5a27f92152f1ae00d26b7f021a88c352224ccde5245de781a5e67a9bfe3f8f5","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f5a27f92152f1ae00d26b7f021a88c352224ccde5245de781a5e67a9bfe3f8f5","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780089949746},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":18,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789191110318},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This web-scraping skill is purpose-aligned and transparent about using browser automation, authenticated pages, and workspace files, with no hidden code or persistence.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Browser/session use and saving scraped results to workspace files can involve sensitive website content, but those behaviors are disclosed and proportionate for a scraping skill.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact is a single Markdown skill file with no executable scripts, dependencies, install hooks, or remote payload retrieval.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger text is somewhat broad and includes monitoring, summaries, pagination, infinite scroll, and login-gated flows, but the runtime workflow directs the agent to identify target sites and exact fields, test one page first, and extract only requested fields.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The only persistence described is task output or checkpoints saved under the workspace with clear names; there is no system persistence, privilege escalation, memory poisoning, or tool hijacking.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill is narrowly about extracting structured information from websites using web_fetch, browser automation, or web_search discovery, and its capabilities fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill can guide an agent to scrape dynamic or login-gated pages and save larger results in the workspace. Use it only for sites and fields you intentionally specify, avoid scraping secrets or unnecessary personal data, and review saved files when working with authenticated content.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad scraping invocation language is real, but the artifact also requires target identification, exact fields, one-page testing, serialized requests, and extracting only requested fields, so this does not rise to Review by itself.\n[SQP-2] expected: Authenticated browsing and workspace output are explicitly mentioned in the skill, and no hidden data flow or external exfiltration path is present; users should still handle login-gated scraped data carefully.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The static scan reported no T01-T09 results, consistent with the artifact containing only straightforward Markdown instructions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789191110318}}}}}